  "details": "<p><em>The Barrington Atlas Directory</em> notes: Sidi Rehane. <em>Statio</em> 11 of the mercantile square known as the\u00a0Piazzale delle Corporazioni (II,VII,4) in Ostia has a mosaic pavement that reads \"<span>NAVICVLARI MVSLV(V)ITANI HIC\".</span><em><br /></em></p>",
